---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Mitchell Haw | SEO & AI Search Consultant"
  description="Learn more about Mitchell Haw, an SEO and AI search consultant based in Bend, Oregon with over 12 years of experience helping businesses improve visibility, rankings, and organic growth."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="section-label">About</p>

        <h1>
          SEO and AI search strategy built around visibility, trust, and long-term growth.
        </h1>

        <p>
          I’m Mitchell Haw, an SEO and organic search consultant based in Bend, Oregon with
          more than 12 years of experience working across the evolving world of search.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>Experience across agencies, in-house teams, and independent consulting</h2>

        <p>
          Over the years, I’ve worked in agency environments, in-house marketing teams,
          through my own agency work, and directly with businesses looking for clearer,
          more practical search strategy.
        </p>

        <p>
          My experience spans local SEO, technical SEO, content strategy, site structure,
          analytics, AI search visibility, and broader organic search growth across platforms
          like Google, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and other emerging search experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’ve worked with local businesses in Bend and Central Oregon as well as larger
          brands operating across multiple cities, locations, and markets.
        </p>

        <p>
          Search continues to change quickly, especially with the growth of AI-generated
          answers and conversational search experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
          That is part of what keeps this work interesting to me. I enjoy helping businesses
          adapt, simplify what matters, and build stronger visibility across Google, maps,
          AI search platforms, and the broader web.
        </p>

        <h2>What I focus on</h2>

        <p>
          I help businesses improve how they appear when people are actively searching for
          products, services, information, and local recommendations.
        </p>

        <p>
          That work can include technical SEO improvements, local SEO, Google Business Profile
          strategy, content planning, internal linking, site architecture, analytics,
          traditional SEO, and visibility within AI-powered search experiences like ChatGPT,
          Perplexity, Gemini, and AI Overviews.
        </p>

        <p>
          I prefer a practical approach. Clear recommendations. Strong foundations.
          Useful content. Better structure. Better visibility. Less noise.
        </p>

        <h2>Based in Bend, Oregon</h2>

        <p>
          Living in Central Oregon gives me a strong understanding of the local business
          landscape here, from tourism and hospitality to outdoor brands, local services,
          real estate, restaurants, wellness companies, and growing small businesses.
        </p>

        <p>
          I also understand that many businesses do not need overly complicated marketing plans.
          Often the biggest gains come from improving the basics, building the right pages,
          strengthening local visibility, and creating a better overall search presence.
        </p>

        <a href="/contact" class="primary-btn">Reach Out</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
